  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Provision of food assistance to refugees living in camps in Western Tanzania through WFP is a component of Refugee Response and Reform: Sustaining lives and securing a sustainable future for refugees and migrants in Western Tanzania reported by FCDO with a funding type of 105 -  Humanitarian assistance and a budget of &#xA3;17,500,000. It works in the following sector(s): Emergency food assistance.</narrative>
